{"id":"ec17b877f67b9c76","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-precompact.md","title":"Precompact","display":"df-precompact — Precompact","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-precompact","aliases":["58-df-precompact","Precompact"],"display":"df-precompact — Precompact","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-totally-bounded.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-precompact"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-precompact</span><span>Precompact</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-precompact — Precompact"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"199139c5a60bcfcc\" href=\"?note=199139c5a60bcfcc\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-totally-bounded.md\">../batch02/58-df-totally-bounded.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,X,d\\in V\">\\(E,X,d\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotallyBounded}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotallyBounded}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"199139c5a60bcfcc\" href=\"?note=199139c5a60bcfcc\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-totally-bounded.md\">../batch02/58-df-totally-bounded.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Precompact}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Precompact}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}precompact}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Precompact}_S(E,X,d)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TotallyBounded}_S(E,X,d).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}precompact}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Precompact}_S(E,X,d)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TotallyBounded}_S(E,X,d).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In metric spaces, precompactness is total boundedness.</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,d)\">\\((X,d)\\)</span> is complete, this is equivalent to compactness of the metric closure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>; without completeness that equivalence fails.</li>\n<li>In <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>, precompactness is equivalent to boundedness, while in general infinite-dimensional normed spaces it is strictly stronger.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-totally-bounded.md","status":"resolved","id":"199139c5a60bcfcc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-totally-bounded.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-totally-bounded.md","status":"resolved","id":"199139c5a60bcfcc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TotallyBounded}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch02/58-df-totally-bounded.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,X,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotallyBounded}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Precompact}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}precompact}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Precompact}_S(E,X,d)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TotallyBounded}_S(E,X,d).","display":true},{"tex":"(X,d)","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^n","display":false}],"bytes":962,"backlinks":[{"id":"28999e0c83253377","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Precompact}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-precompact.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-975","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-precompact.md|58-df-precompact]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["199139c5a60bcfcc"]}